---
import ArtifactShowcase from "../components/ArtifactShowcase.astro";
import HeroGame from "../components/HeroGame.astro";
import LandingSection from "../components/LandingSection.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pl">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="KURCZOKER is a browser mini roguelite with a playable canvas hero, odd artifacts, and compact fantasy battles."
    />
    <title>KURCZOKER</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <HeroGame />

      <LandingSection
        eyebrow="Run loop"
        title="A tiny fantasy run built for one more attempt"
        tone="light"
      >
        <div class="section-grid section-grid--three">
          <article class="feature-tile">
            <span class="feature-tile__mark">01</span>
            <h3>Pick a path</h3>
            <p>Move through short map branches with battles, treasure, shops, elites, and a final boss node.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-tile">
            <span class="feature-tile__mark">02</span>
            <h3>Win the turn</h3>
            <p>Every fight favors fast reads, arcing shots, risky jumps, and visible enemy answers.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-tile">
            <span class="feature-tile__mark">03</span>
            <h3>Break the build</h3>
            <p>Artifacts and abilities stack into stranger runs without accounts, grind, or backend state.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </LandingSection>

      <ArtifactShowcase />

      <LandingSection
        eyebrow="Roadmap"
        title="The shell is ready for the roguelite systems"
        tone="dark"
      >
        <div class="roadmap">
          <p>
            Wave 1A establishes the static Astro site, the first-viewport game mount, and the landing
            presentation. The existing game contracts remain the boundary for the next waves.
          </p>
          <ul class="roadmap__list">
            <li>Node map and run state</li>
            <li>Active-turn battle loop</li>
            <li>Projectile physics and enemy response</li>
            <li>Rewards, artifacts, summons, and audio</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </LandingSection>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
